   "properties": {
    "description": "Nike is a premier global powerhouse in athletic performance, renowned for its relentless commitment to technological innovation and design excellence. Established in 1964, the brand serves a vast, diverse audience ranging from world-class elite athletes to everyday fitness enthusiasts. It maintains a strong market position through a comprehensive range of sportswear, footwear, and equipment that blends high functionality with universal cultural appeal. Beyond its products, the company actively engages in significant social advocacy, supporting community well-being and equality initiatives through its influential platform.",
